      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## MLOps Data Quality Monitoring\n\nTracks the quality and completeness of training data: label coverage, drift detection events, signal validation errors, and processing latency.\n\n### Key Panels\n| Panel | What to look for |\n|:------|:-----------------|\n| Label Coverage (%) | Should stay above 30% \u2014 below 20% triggers `CriticalLabelCoverage` alert |\n| Labels Injected (24h) | New labels injected via `/inject-label` in last 24 hours |\n| Drift Detections (1h) | EvidentlyAI drift events in last hour \u2014 spike indicates distribution shift |\n| Label Injection Rate by Label | Rate of healthy (0) vs faulty (1) labels injected over time |\n\n**Data sources:** `labels_injected_total[label_value]`, `drift_detections_total`, `invalid_signals_total`, `sparse_label_coverage`, `signal_validation_duration_seconds`\n\n*Last updated: Session 10 \u2014 GF-8/9/10 metric corrections applied*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.2.3",
      "title": "Dashboard Information",
      "type": "text"
